      "id": 1,
      "text": "New Albany was platted in 1837 by Noble Landon and William Yantis, who divided the town into 72 lots of 50 by 100 feet.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
