      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The New Albany‑Plain Township Historical Society, founded in 1975, preserves local history through museums, tours, and a heritage quilt depicting 1800s‑era life.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        15,
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
